            "detailed_description": "Just when you were finally done with work for the day, a stranger comes knocking loudly at your door. When you answer there's no one... no one except a helpless baby abandoned on your doorstep. You follow after the stranger, hoping to find some answers but are drawn into a mystery that beckons you into a castle-like mansion. Who does the baby belong to? Why were you chosen? The answers will surprise you in Nevertales: The Beauty Within, a page-turning Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won’t find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Three bonus chapters<br />\r\n- Multiple collectibles and achievements<br />\r\n- Sugar Rush Hidden Object Puzzle<br />\r\n- Integrated Strategy Guide",
